    "product": {
      "id": 1017030,
      "name": "Cornito Peppers",
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cornito peppers are&nbsp;sweet, tapering peppers with a mild flavor, ideal for cooking methods like grilling, roasting, and frying, though they are also delicious when eaten raw.&nbsp;They are a smaller, earlier-maturing variety of the Italian \"Corno di Toro\" (bull's horn) pepper, coming in colors like red (Rosso), yellow (Giallo), and orange (Arancia).&nbsp;Their flavor intensifies with cooking, but they can be used fresh in salads or as a snack. </span></p>",
